<title>BELGIUM: Belgium to be in 1st group of EMU members-Maystadt.</title>
<headline>Belgium to be in 1st group of EMU members-Maystadt.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Finance Minister Philippe Maystadt said on Monday he was confident Belgium would be among the first group of countries forming an economic and monetary union in Europe.  </p>
<p>&quot;I am confident that Belgium will meet the Maastricht Treaty criteria and that we will be part of the first group of countries to joining the single currency,&quot; he told a news conference after a meeting of EU Finance Ministers.</p>
<p>The ministers reviewed Belgium's updated EMU convergence programme at the meeting and said that they considered it adequate and credible.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
